# Testing (Importou)

## Where tests live

- Unit (`@unit`): entities, VOs, pure builders/formatters.
- Integration (`@integration`): handlers/services with mocked repos/DAO (makeSut).
- Do **not** unit-test thin HTTP gateway stubs that only forward to an external API until there is real branching worth locking.

## Principles

- AAA (Arrange / Act / Assert).
- Assert domain status via enums, not magic strings.
- Prefer behavior over implementation details.
- No real network in unit/integration.

$END$
